<title>USA: GTE says Internet subscribers top 100,000.</title>
<headline>GTE says Internet subscribers top 100,000.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp on Thursday said the number of subscribers using its GTE Internet Solutions service to access the Internet has topped 100,000.</p>
<p>GTE introduced its nationwide Internet access service in July 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
